# Copy to .env.local (gitignored) if you need overrides.
# No Slack bot/user tokens required — Approve writes a durable outbox;
# Grok posts via Slack MCP and acks the outbox item.
# No GitHub tokens — watcher/agent POSTs canonical events; Control never calls GitHub.
# Chip 5: Confirm enqueues GitHub outbox via API; run ./scripts/github-outbox-worker (operator gh). No credentials in Control.

# Optional overrides (defaults are the Control E2E harness):
# SLACK_E2E_CHANNEL_ID=C0BVCSA4T2P
# SLACK_E2E_THREAD_TS=1788808933.776429

# V0.8 — Local Pro Claude worker talks HTTP only (CONTROL_BASE_URL).
# Live default = worker when unset. Enqueue via POST /api/review/run; claim/result APIs.
#   CONTROL_BASE_URL=http://localhost:3000 ./scripts/control-review-worker --once
#   CONTROL_BASE_URL=http://localhost:3000 ./scripts/control-review-worker --watch
# CONTROL_BASE_URL=http://localhost:3000
# Auth: `claude` login (same user) OR CLAUDE_CODE_OAUTH_TOKEN from `claude setup-token`.
# Do NOT require Console ANTHROPIC_API_KEY for dogfood (worker unsets it).
# CONTROL_REVIEW_BACKEND=worker
# fake = CI/smoke/Demo QA only — do NOT use as Live default.
# CONTROL_REVIEW_BACKEND=fake
# command = external --in/--out wrapper (unchanged).
# CONTROL_REVIEW_BACKEND=command
# CONTROL_REVIEW_COMMAND=my-pr-review --in {{in}} --out {{out}}
# claude-cli = advanced/opt-in server-spawn (prefer worker for dogfood).
# CONTROL_REVIEW_BACKEND=claude-cli
# CONTROL_REVIEW_BACKEND=cursor-cloud
